WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.720
The first CTE performs representation normalization
It does

00:00:05.733 --> 00:00:11.483
not yet claim that the values are valid Names are
cleaned for whitespace

00:00:13.219 --> 00:00:18.835
Emails are trimmed and lowercased Phone values
become digit-only

00:00:18.861 --> 00:00:26.018
candidates The raw signup date is carried forward
unchanged This

00:00:26.045 --> 00:00:28.992
separation makes the pipeline easier to reason about
